+/*
+ * Stock's CONSYS bring-up is not expected to succeed on the first attempt: a
+ * healthy stock boot logs "do common driver init failed, ret:-1" and a chip-ID
+ * read of 0x00000000, then retries for about sixteen seconds before Wi-Fi
+ * appears.  This bring-up used to be single-shot, so one transient WMT failure
+ * left the controller down until the device was power-cycled.
+ *
+ * mt8163_stp_wmt_xfer_mask() already retries an individual transfer, but only
+ * once the link is in full STP mode; bootstrap opens in mandatory mode, so its
+ * first exchanges had no cover at all.
